  "question": "Which caf\u00e9 is closest when moving in the west direction from Fran Rish Stadium, Richland, WA?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-119.286251 46.275954)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.amenity = 'cafe'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 247.5 AND 292.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
